## Quests You Could Raise
The following are outstanding quests/tasks you are currently seeking help with. They are formatted as full dialogue branches and separated by quest name. Indentation shows how a conversation could unfold; where a branch splits, those are genuine alternative paths (fight it out, pay, talk them down, and so on). {{ player.name }} cannot see the details of these quests — what they involve or what choices they hold — and learns them only through the conversation.
- Bring them up when speaking with {{ player.name }}
- When moving one forward is more than a simple yes or a turn-in, make the way forward clear — guide {{ player.name }} toward what they can do, in your own words
- Where a matter splits into different paths, voice them as real choices so {{ player.name }} knows there's a decision to make
- Respond in your own words
- Follow the flow of the conversation

Quest topics are formatted as a full example dialogue chain, separated by a header:
